CHAPTER XI

GUIDANCE AND SUPERVISION

Article 19

1. The Regional Government is obliged to conduct guidance and supervision of the implementation of protection of women and children from violence. (2) Guidance as referred to in paragraph (1), includes: a. guidelines and fulfillment standards;
b. technical guidance;
c. education and training;
d. provision of facilities;
e. monitoring;andf. evaluation.
3. In order to realize the objectives of protecting women and children from acts of violence, guidance as referred to in paragraph (2) is implemented in accordance with minimum service standards.
